config ESP8089
	tristate "Espressif ESP8089 SDIO WiFi support"
	depends on WL_ROCKCHIP && MMC
	help
	  This enables the Espressif ESP8089 SDIO wireless LAN driver
	  integrated with the Rockchip rfkill and SDIO bring-up path.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here. The module
	  will be called esp8089.
